      "end_ms": 68100,
      "id": "e_056",
      "scene_id": "sc_003",
      "type": "camera",
      "text": "Wide eye-level shot looking down the petal-strewn marble aisle. A tall, rugged man in a worn dark trench coat—The Bearded Stranger—emerges into the center of the nave.",
